  "TotallyDefiniteQuaternionAlgebra.HeckeAlgebra.Eigenform.isInternal",
  "oldText": "simp [h₁]",
  "message":
  "this parameter is redundant, environment already contains `Subtype.property` annotated with `@[grind]`Try these:\n  [apply] grind only [usr Set.mem_setOf_eq, usr Subtype.property, #c551]\n  [apply] grind only [usr Set.mem_setOf_eq, usr Subtype.property]\n  [apply] grind =>\n    instantiate only [usr Set.mem_setOf_eq, usr Subtype.property, #c551]\n    done",
  "goalIsProp": true,
  "filepath":
  "/data/FLT/FLT/AutomorphicForm/QuaternionAlgebra/InnerProduct.lean"},
 {"tacticSucceeded": false,
  "startLine": 614,
  "startCol": 2,
  "shortenedStepsCount": 0,
  "parentName":
  "TotallyDefiniteQuaternionAlgebra.HeckeAlgebra.Eigenform.isInternal",
  "oldText":
  "classical\n  refine (LinearMap.IsSymmetric.directSum_isInternal_of_pairwise_commute\n    (n := { v | v ∉ 𝒮.S ∧ v ∉ 𝒮.Q })\n    (T := fun v ↦ Module.toModuleEnd ℂ ((U₁ 𝒮).toStruct.form D ℂ) (T D 𝒮 v.1 v.2.1 v.2.2))\n    (fun v ↦ isSymmetric_toModuleEnd_T _ _ _ v.2.1 v.2.2)\n    (fun v w _ ↦ by ext1; simp [← mul_smul, mul_comm])).reindex (κ := Eigenform D 𝒮)\n      (B := Eigenform.eigenspace) (fun 𝒻 v ↦ 𝒻.eigenvalue v.1 v.2.1 v.2.2) ?_ ?_ ?_\n  · intro 𝒻 𝒻' e\n    exact Eigenform.eigenvalue_injective (by ext v hvS hvQ; exact congr($e ⟨v, hvS, hvQ⟩))\n  · intro 𝒻\n    ext v\n    simp [Eigenform.mem_eigenspace_iff_T]\n  · intro f hf μ hμ\n    by_contra hμ'\n    obtain ⟨𝒻, h₁, h₂⟩ := Eigenform.exists (fun v hvS hvQ ↦ f ⟨v, hvS, hvQ⟩) μ hμ'\n      (by simpa using hμ)\n    exact hf ⟨𝒻, funext (by simp [h₁])⟩",
  "message": null,
  "goalIsProp": true,
  "filepath":
  "/data/FLT/FLT/AutomorphicForm/QuaternionAlgebra/InnerProduct.lean"},
 {"tacticSucceeded": false,
